1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,800
I'm your China Travel Expert.
我是你的中国旅游专家

2
00:00:02,000 --> 00:00:04,200
In China, one spring can cook your lunch.
中国有眼泉，能煮午饭

3
00:00:04,400 --> 00:00:06,600
The water boils at 97°C, day and night.
97度，昼夜翻滚

4
00:00:06,800 --> 00:00:09,000
It's Rehai, in Tengchong, Yunnan.
云南腾冲，热海

5
00:00:09,200 --> 00:00:11,400
A volcano heats it from below.
底下是火山在烧

6
00:00:11,600 --> 00:00:13,800
Lower a basket of eggs — done in half an hour.
篮子一放，半小时熟

7
00:00:14,000 --> 00:00:16,200
Over 80 springs steam across the valley.
山谷里80多眼泉

8
00:00:16,400 --> 00:00:18,600
Double-tap if you'd soak here this autumn.
秋天想来泡的点赞

9
00:00:18,800 --> 00:00:21,000
Cook first, then soak in the warm pools.
先煮饭，再泡汤

10
00:00:21,200 --> 00:00:23,200
Autumn into winter is hot-spring season.
秋冬正是温泉季

11
00:00:23,400 --> 00:00:26,200
★ Expert Tip: bring eggs and peanuts — vendors rent a basket to boil them.
内行提示：自带蛋来煮

12
00:00:26,400 --> 00:00:28,600
Would you eat from a volcano — or just soak?
你敢吃火山煮的饭吗？评论见
